WEBVTT

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:08.500
Local organisations know
exactly what they need.

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:11.500
Handova helps them get it,
and keep it.

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:15.500
Too much volunteering starts from
what the helper wants to give.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:18.500
Handova starts from what
the organisation needs.

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:24.500
First, the organisation
defines the need:

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:28.000
one clear output,
in up to sixteen hours.

00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:37.250
Approved professionals apply
with a short plan,

00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:40.000
or the organisation invites
someone whose work fits.

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:47.250
Both sides sign the scope
before any work starts,

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:49.750
and before anything
confidential is shared.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:56.750
The work happens remotely,
in a few focused hours,

00:00:56.750 --> 00:00:59.500
built with the team
so they can run it alone.

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:04.000
Then it's handed over.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:06.000
The team keeps the capability.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:09.250
The professional gets a reviewed
record on their impact CV.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:15.750
It's free for everyone.

00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:17.750
Every profile is reviewed first,

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:20.750
and hours and outcomes
come from the organisation.

00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:27.750
Join the founding group
at handova.org.

00:01:28.250 --> 00:01:30.500
Hand over something that lasts.
